---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['washington-county'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Washington County | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Washington County, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Skilled Legal Representation in Washington County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Washington County, centered around historic Hagerstown, serves as a major crossroads in 
    western Maryland where I-70 and I-81 intersect. This strategic location brings significant 
    commercial traffic and, unfortunately, increased risk of serious accidents. Attorney Alex 
    Poberesky provides experienced legal representation to Washington County residents facing 
    personal injury claims and criminal charges.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Washington County</h3>
  
  <p>
    The intersection of two major interstate highways makes Washington County a hub for 
    trucking and commercial transportation. Accidents involving large commercial vehicles 
    can cause catastrophic injuries. We help victims of these accidents and other personal 
    injury cases recover the compensation they need to move forward.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle all types of personal injury cases in Washington County, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Truck accidents on I-70 and I-81</li>
    <li>Car accidents throughout the county</li>
    <li>Motorcycle accidents</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries at distribution centers and manufacturing facilities</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at Meritus Medical Center and other healthcare facilities</li>
    <li>Construction accidents</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Washington County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Criminal charges in Washington County can have serious consequences for your future. 
    Whether you're facing DUI charges, drug offenses, assault, theft, or other criminal matters, 
    you need an attorney who will fight aggressively for your rights in the Washington County 
    court system.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Experience That Matters</h3>
  
  <p>
    With over 26 years of experience practicing law throughout Maryland, Attorney Poberesky 
    brings the knowledge and skill needed to handle complex cases in Washington County. We 
    travel to Hagerstown and surrounding areas to meet with clients and provide the personalized 
    attention every case deserves.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Washington County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Washington County, including Hagerstown, Williamsport, 
    Boonsboro, Smithsburg, Hancock, Funkstown, Clear Spring, and Sharpsburg. No matter where 
    in the county you need legal help, we're ready to fight for you.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
